
========================================================================
  THE LOCKED GATE
========================================================================
Seed: 1

== The Gate ==

A rusty gate blocks the road. A lamp hangs on a hook beside it.

Who are you? [final]
  1. The Fighter
     Strong arms.
  2. The Wizard
     One spell.
> 1

Role: fighter

What do you do? [plan]
  1. Take the lamp
  2. Walk away
> 1

The lamp is warm. Someone lit it today.

== The Yard ==

Past the gate is a yard with a dark well.

Your lamp shows a ladder inside the well.

Role: fighter

What do you do at the well? [final]
  1. Climb down the ladder
  2. Lift the stone lid
     Fighter only.
  3. Go home
> 2

************************************************************************
  DOWN THE WELL
************************************************************************

At the bottom is a dry room and an old chest.

You lift the chest with one hand.

THE END
Trail: gate > yard > treasure
r = play again, q = quit > q
Goodbye.
